[1mThe crate did not compile as delivered[22m — 45 [38;5;10mE0761[0m errors. Two complete, parallel translations of every module had been left in the tree: a [3mflat[23m one ([38;5;10msrc/crypto_hash/sha256.rs[0m) and a [3mdirectory[23m one mirroring the C layout ([38;5;10msrc/crypto_hash/sha256/{mod.rs,…}[0m), so every [38;5;10mpub mod X;[0m was ambiguous. The flat set is what the module tree actually references ([38;5;10mlib.rs[0m declares [38;5;10msodium_codecs[0m/[38;5;10msodium_core[0m as flat files; [38;5;10mcrypto_core/mod.rs[0m declares [38;5;10med25519_ref10[0m, a name that exists only in the flat layout). Removing the shadowing directories plus four orphan directories no parent declared left symbol parity untouched — confirmed by the 0/0 [38;5;10mnm -D[0m diff.[0m[0m
